Subject: [PATCH] sprd: peripherals support for UMS512

Consolidated from beebono/linux-mainline-sprd rg-rotate 464b3e7bf45bb300e190339977abba36c8078e1f, rebased onto Linux 7.1.2.
Original authors and patch hashes are recorded in series-origin.json.

diff --git a/drivers/dma/sprd-dma.c b/drivers/dma/sprd-dma.c
index 087fea3af2e41140695518a9f9b3365cb3a42c63..fdc33bdb04e56f8b55415165da4f55f15bda3b2d 100644
--- a/drivers/dma/sprd-dma.c
